<section class="section" aria-labelledby="does-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="case-title" id="does-title">What it does for your business</h2>
    <div class="grid-2 case-features">
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Fast check-in by plate</h3><ul><li>Type the plate and the customer, vehicle and history appear.</li><li>Scans ID cards and vehicle registration.</li><li>Automatic rates by vehicle type, combos and partner agreements.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Every vehicle, in real time</h3><ul><li>Statuses: registered, waiting, in progress, quality check, ready and delivered.</li><li>Ticket with a pickup code: the car only leaves with its owner.</li><li>Public tracking and “vehicle ready” alerts via WhatsApp and email.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Workers and commissions, no arguments</h3><ul><li>One or more washers per service, each with their share.</li><li>Commissions by percentage or fixed amount, with advances and vouchers.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>A cash register that balances</h3><ul><li>Shifts with opening float, expenses and partial withdrawals.</li><li>Blind closing: the cashier declares and the system shows any discrepancy.</li><li>Mixed payments: cash, transfer, card, Nequi and Daviplata.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Supplies inventory</h3><ul><li>Each service deducts its supplies automatically.</li><li>Stock ledger, purchases, transfers between locations and low-stock alerts.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Returning customers and DIAN invoicing</h3><ul><li>Plate-based loyalty: “every N washes, one free”.</li><li>Electronic invoicing, credit notes and resolution control.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Peace of mind for the owner, anywhere</h3><ul><li>Multiple locations with roles: administrator, supervisor, cashier, front desk and worker.</li><li>Sensitive operations require a supervisor PIN and are fully logged.</li><li>Daily summary for the owner and compliance with Ley 1581.</li></ul></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
